e=\"color:#ff0000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e+ 03 túi (50cm x 70cm) + 03 túi (60cm x 80cm) + 02 túi (80cm x 110cm)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align:left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#ff0000;\"\u003e+\u003c/span\u003e Hoặc\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cspan style=\"color:#ff0000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e04 túi (70cm x 100cm) + 04 túi (60cm x 80cm) \u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align:left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#000000;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTặng kèm 01 bơm tay (không có dây dẫn nhựa)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align:left;\"\u003e- Mỗi túi có 01 nắp đậy van bơm có ren xoay + 1 kẹp khí.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align:left;\"\u003e- Chất liệu: Nhựa nilon mềm và dai kín khí, bơm tay bằng nhựa,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align:left;\"\u003e- Trọng lượng: \u003cspan style=\"color:#993366;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e900g\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e, kích thước đóng gói: \u003cspan style=\"color:#993366;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e25cm x 45cm x 10cm\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align:left;\"\u003e- \u003cstrong\u003eKhông\u003c/strong\u003e tặng bơm máy (\u003cstrong\u003eQuý khách lưu ý\u003c/strong\u003e); sản phẩm có thể dùng máy hút bụi gia đình để hút tiện lợi\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/e6/06/b7/45ff9da01264cdb03f7e1cb952d5147a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"620\" height=\"749\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/5e/ff/91/c5fc65635d17a3d9885812e72e190d5a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/70/9b/ae/0ecedd4799e2cedbc0060f79ed7fd92c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"601\" /\u00